# =============================================================================
# Internal source data — DO NOT COMMIT
# =============================================================================
# This is the unsanitized source spreadsheet that the public catalogue is built
# from. It contains client names, employee names, internal URLs, ticket numbers,
# tenant IDs, and workflow IDs. It must never reach the public repo.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.csv

# =============================================================================
# AI / Claude working files
# =============================================================================
# CLAUDE.md is guidance for AI agents editing this repo. It's useful locally
# but not part of the public catalogue. Other AI tools (Cursor, Copilot Chat)
# may also drop files here.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
.continue/

# =============================================================================
# Internal project documents (uncomment to ignore from public repo)
# =============================================================================
# These two are referenced by ~15 public files. If you ignore them, the public
# repo will have broken links. See the chat conversation that created this file
# for the cross-reference inventory. Recommended: leave commented out so these
# stay public.
#
# Rules.md
# ProjectSpec.md

